<title>SPAIN: Telefonica says to hold news conference.</title>
<headline>Telefonica says to hold news conference.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Telefonica de Espana would not comment on Friday on an alliance with British Telecommunications and MCI Communications Corp, but said it would hold a news conference later in the morning.</p>
<p>&quot;We can not give any information at the moment,&quot; a Telefonica spokesman said. &quot;The chairman will reveal the final position with respect to the Telefonica International alliance at a press conference at 1300 local time (1100 GMT).&quot;</p>
<p>British Telecommunications said on Friday it had formed a global telecoms alliance with U.S. group MCI Communications Corp and Telefonica.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2161</p>
